      "content": "That's a good start, but those feel like pretty standard economic talking points. I need something harder hitting for the actual debate rounds. Can you look at the moral and social arguments for UBI—like the \"dignity of work\" or \"freedom from exploitation\" angles—and show me how to totally dismantle them so the opposition has no ground to stand on?",
